out but not holding my breath for truth to be outed.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/2072843056960269293'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/2072843056960269293'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295803602520#c2072843056960269293' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 23, 2011 at 10:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5008282897433240162</id><published>2011-01-22T07:43:39.496-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-22T07:43:39.496-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Unabomber = Blowback</title><content type='html'>Unabomber = Blowback</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5008282897433240162'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5008282897433240162'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295707419496#c5008282897433240162' title=''/><author><name>D. Saul Weiner</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03294245259077659002</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-292891816"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 22, 2011 at 7:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7204398635882801769</id><published>2011-01-20T18:57:35.228-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-20T18:57:35.228-07:00</updated><title type='text'>@WhiteBuffalo&#xa;&#xa;You are absolutely correct in point...</title><content type='html'>@WhiteBuffalo&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You are absolutely correct in pointing out that our Kongress Kritters never miss an opportunity to have their face plastered either by the TeeVee (preferable) or local news rag (plan B).  So it begs the question: Whats up with that?!  Just like all other &amp;quot;evidence&amp;quot; that gets sanitized, or experiences convenient &amp;quot;technical difficulties&amp;quot;, you wonder if this too will mutate.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/7204398635882801769'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/7204398635882801769'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295575055228#c7204398635882801769' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2011 at 6:57 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1655075899663238071</id><published>2011-01-20T12:51:01.648-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-20T12:51:01.648-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;#39;Kaczynski&amp;#39;s self-appointed mission as an ...</title><content type='html'>&amp;#39;Kaczynski&amp;#39;s self-appointed mission as an apostle of &amp;quot;revolutionary violence&amp;quot; was triggered by something he experienced at Harvard.&amp;#39;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Likewise, one fears that Bernanke&amp;#39;s self-appointed mission as an apostle of &amp;quot;revolutionary monetization&amp;quot; was triggered by something he experienced at Harvard. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Today begins the 23rd year of the Harvard-Yale presidency (the Bush-Clinton-Bush-Obama administration). To paraphrase Ed Koch, &amp;quot;How are we doin&amp;#39;?&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/1655075899663238071'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/1655075899663238071'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295553061648#c1655075899663238071' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-567077632"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2011 at 12:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2314117921778041973</id><published>2011-01-20T08:22:04.968-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-20T08:22:04.968-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Interesting related info by Daniel Pride ...&#xa;&#xa;http...</title><content type='html'>Interesting related info by Daniel Pride ...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.unabombers.com/ManchurianCandidate.htm</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/2314117921778041973'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/2314117921778041973'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295536924968#c2314117921778041973' title=''/><author><name>Greg</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-291020853"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2011 at 8:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5114238674600828751</id><published>2011-01-20T05:56:06.695-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-20T05:56:06.695-07:00</updated><title type='text'>rctlfy said...&#xa;&#xa;    @whitebuffalo&#xa;    They have a ...</title><content type='html'>rctlfy said...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;    @whitebuffalo&lt;br /&gt;    They have a video&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So far we only have reports that there is a video.  I have yet to see it. And isn&amp;#39;t it curious that it has taken over a week for the video to come to light? Just like the &amp;quot;video&amp;quot; of the plane hitting the Pentagram - I mean Pentagon - being released to the public way late, this &amp;quot;video&amp;quot; will also be very sketchy on details. I ask again, since when does a congress critter do a meet and greet with the public and not insist there be a local TV news crew there to cover the wonderful event?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5114238674600828751'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5114238674600828751'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295528166695#c5114238674600828751' title=''/><author><name>whitebuffalo</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-463568285"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2011 at 5:56 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5641071301478703410</id><published>2011-01-20T00:37:23.077-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-20T00:37:23.077-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Lawyers who handle capital felony trials are speci...</title><content type='html'>Lawyers who handle capital felony trials are specialized; SCOTUS has commented on the fact that PD&amp;#39;s have had a history of failure to adequately represent clients.  We see the same lawyers because of the The Capital Defense and Trial Services Unit. http://www.cga.ct.gov/2005/rpt/2005-R-0158.htm  States</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5641071301478703410'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5641071301478703410'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295509043077#c5641071301478703410' title=''/><author><name>rctlfy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07910695061885053363</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1912794184"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2011 at 12:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1421110187959090567</id><published>2011-01-19T23:27:27.808-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-19T23:27:27.808-07:00</updated><title type='text'>How coincidental that the same Lawyer is used time...</title><content type='html'>How coincidental that the same Lawyer is used time and again for so-called &amp;quot;crazies&amp;quot;.  Not!!!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/1421110187959090567'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/1421110187959090567'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295504847808#c1421110187959090567' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 19, 2011 at 11:27 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5214386609799409456</id><published>2011-01-19T22:34:55.565-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-19T22:34:55.565-07:00</updated><title type='text'>@whitebuffalo&#xa;They have a video&#xa;&#xa;http://www.nytime...</title><content type='html'>@whitebuffalo&lt;br /&gt;They have a video&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/19/us/19giffords.html?_r=1&amp;amp;ref=arizonashooting2011</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5214386609799409456'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/5214386609799409456'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295501695565#c5214386609799409456' title=''/><author><name>rctlfy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07910695061885053363</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1912794184"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 19, 2011 at 10:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3135279880607859939</id><published>2011-01-19T22:09:49.973-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-19T22:09:49.973-07:00</updated><title type='text'>el obscuro said...&#xa;&#xa;    &amp;quot;Books by Hitler and ...</title><content type='html'>el obscuro said...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;    &amp;quot;Books by Hitler and Marx are what set off the bravo sierra detector. If you like one you are not going to like the other.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Actually, the difference twix the two is very minimal. The evil of both political philosophies is based on the belief that the individual is subservient to the state. Indeed, I would argue that Hitler was less evil than Stalin because Hitler at least loved something more than himself - he loved the Germanic people.  Whereas the truly psychopathic Stalin loved only power - raw unrestrained power as described by the Capitalist-tool Lenin.&lt;br /&gt;This same belief that the individual is subservient to the state is at the heart of the problem facing Amerika today. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But as to your suggestion that the judge was the true target, I could not agree more. Something is not as it seems here. The timing of this, the players involved, the political theater, the lack of video on the actual shooting, something false flag/covert op smacks here. The gov&amp;#39;ment is always guilty until proven - by a jury - innocent.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/3135279880607859939'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/3135279880607859939'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295500189973#c3135279880607859939' title=''/><author><name>whitebuffalo</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndicati