ontent><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/4879870955975002833'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/4879870955975002833'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295396129067#c4879870955975002833' title=''/><author><name>rctlfy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07910695061885053363</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1912794184"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 18, 2011 at 5:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9079672233565046417</id><published>2011-01-18T12:34:37.503-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-18T12:34:37.503-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Concise as usual.&#xa;&#xa;Thought for a moment you were a...</title><content type='html'>Concise as usual.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thought for a moment you were about to mention the oddity of Laurel Canyon as a segue from this line:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;A 1967 internal CIA assessment documented that hundreds of professors on more than 100 college campuses were involved in clandestine experiments connected to MK Ultra.&lt;/i&gt; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For the uninitiated one may read up on how the sons and daughters of the Military Industrial Complex and families of privilege,  congregated in this particular area.  From which spawned the hippie movement, the counter cultures flagship rock groups and film icons.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Suicides, murders, arson, etc., were rife amongst the inhabitants.  The most notable being the underlying influence of Charles Manson. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For the reporting written by David McGowan you&amp;#39;ll need to visit the following link as his website tends to exceed allotted bandwidth most of the time:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.illuminati-news.com/articles2/00201.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pay particular attention to the facility at the top of the canyon - The Lookout Mountain Laboratory.&lt;br /&gt;Where the facility retained as many as 250 producers, directors, technicians, editors, animators, etc., both civilian and military, all with top security clearances – and all reporting to work in a secluded corner of Laurel Canyon.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Then ask how the son of an US Navy Admiral; with no background or interest in music, arrived on the music scene with songs and music pre-packaged and destined for pop super stardom and early death.  Especially since the father was at the heart of the Tonkin Bay Incident - George Stephen Morrison.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Dr. Strangelove’s Workplace indeed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank You Mr. Grigg for your tireless efforts.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mundaned in Montana</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/9079672233565046417'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/9079672233565046417'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295379277503#c9079672233565046417' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1855932003"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 18, 2011 at 12:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4958346298481333747</id><published>2011-01-18T07:57:44.152-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-18T07:57:44.152-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The one thing I&amp;#39;ve realized over the past coup...</title><content type='html'>The one thing I&amp;#39;ve realized over the past couple of days in regards to the Tucson shooting is that Giffords wasn&amp;#39;t the primary target.  If I remember correctly, didn&amp;#39;t the federal judge who was killed issue a recent ruling against one of king Obama&amp;#39;s imperial decrees?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/4958346298481333747'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/4958346298481333747'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295362664152#c4958346298481333747' title=''/><author><name>Dave P.</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1030799193"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 18, 2011 at 7:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7982622587678572434</id><published>2011-01-18T06:43:48.639-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-18T06:43:48.639-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Books by Hitler and Marx are what set off the brav...</title><content type='html'>Books by Hitler and Marx are what set off the bravo sierra detector. If you like one you are not going to like the other. An obscure Russian page had an interesting theory, Judge Roll had ruled against federal money confiscation and was the target in Tuscon.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/7982622587678572434'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/7982622587678572434'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295358228639#c7982622587678572434' title=''/><author><name>el obscuro</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4907157648111982956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4907157648111982956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1176995275"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 18, 2011 at 6:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6379140149451297351</id><published>2011-01-18T01:50:59.729-07:00</published><updated>2011-01-18T01:50:59.729-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The scariest thing I ever did in college was read ...</title><content type='html'>The scariest thing I ever did in college was read 1984 while taking the standard Psych 101 class. It was absolutely shocking to me the way most people can be manipulated into doing just about whatever you want if you have a good enough understanding of how the mind works. The marketing industry knows this, and uses it to great effect in ways we don&amp;#39;t even notice to get us to buy what they&amp;#39;re selling. It would be foolish to believe the government and its assets in the faux-free media aren&amp;#39;t doing the same thing to us every day - although the &amp;#39;products&amp;#39; they&amp;#39;re selling are wars, torture, mass imprisonment, heavy taxes, a constantly shrinking circle of freedoms, and generalized poverty (&amp;#39;austerity&amp;#39;), etc. We&amp;#39;re doomed until we collectively wise up to all the ways - most of them very subtle and subconscious - our thoughts are being controlled and manipulated every day.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/6379140149451297351'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4907157648111982956/comments/default/6379140149451297351'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/01/who-gave-you-permission-to-notice.html?showComment=1295340659729#c6379140149451297351' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img